lor:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">standardized</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font></div></code></div>by summary function,  we can get the standard effect of A--&gt;B, and I want to know how to get the standard effect of x--&gt;B, and y --&gt;B.</div><div>I am wondering this so much, can anyone help me ?</div><div><br><br></div><div><br><br></div></div>"
